+title: Continuo
+repo: https://github.com/realartsbro/continuo
+sha: "121dbb2bf7c596a995e19b23b171d9607ff3a5e6"
+version: "1.0.0"
+description: "A film studio inside Hermes: write the script, make pictures and video takes on your own GPU through ComfyUI, cut them to music and render the film, with Hermes working in the same project on every page. The bundled Sample film needs no model: open it, change the cut and render an MP4. Disclosure — runs ffmpeg and ffprobe, and the optional analysis engines you install, each with a minimal environment; talks to a ComfyUI on this machine (127.0.0.1:8188, then 127.0.0.1:8000) or at the address you set in FILM_SUITE_COMFY_URL, where prompts and pictures are sent; fetches LoRA lookups and previews from Civitai when you ask and style thumbnails from Krea when a style board you open has none cached; the optional engine installers download hash-locked packages from PyPI, PyTorch, GitHub and JKU; reads and writes only the folders you approve, plus its own data under the Hermes home and a local cache folder; keeps a per-profile receipt key; treats a request from this computer to its plugin page in the Hermes desktop app as you, after Hermes has authenticated it; no telemetry."
+maintainer: Arts Bro
+tier: community
+category: desktop
+requires_hermes: ">=0.22.7"
+docs_url: https://github.com/realartsbro/continuo#readme
+image: "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/realartsbro/continuo/121dbb2bf7c596a995e19b23b171d9607ff3a5e6/docs/media/banner-1200x600.png"
+readme: true
+platforms: [windows]
+known_issues:
+  - "Needs ffmpeg on PATH, in FFMPEG_PATH or in C:\\ffmpeg\\bin for Cut, Audio and Deliver (the Sample film included)."
+  - "Generating pictures, video, music and voice needs a ComfyUI on this machine (http://127.0.0.1:8188 or http://127.0.0.1:8000; another address through FILM_SUITE_COMFY_URL), a GPU and the models of each workflow (no model ships; the README lists every file and size). Script, Cut, beat analysis and Deliver run on the CPU without them."
+  - "After a command-line install the Continuo window is off: turn it on under Capabilities > Plugins > Continuo (`hermes plugins enable` turns on only the agent's tools). Enabling sets up its Python packages (numpy, librosa, soundfile, httpx, Pillow; 511 MB measured)."
